## Source data

Source data is not redistributed. `{{ d }}data/raw/` and `{{ d }}data/processed/` are
gitignored, and `just pipeline` downloads from each publisher on every run. The CI
artifact holds only the `*.fetch.json` records (URL, timestamp, checksum, byte
count, vintage), not values.

Each source's terms are in [`{{ d }}sources.toml`]({{ d }}sources.toml) (`terms` and
`terms_url`), and `just validate` fails when an implemented source has none. Keep
this table in step with that file.

| Source | Terms as stated by the publisher |
| --- | --- |
| Mauna Loa CO2 annual mean (EXAMPLE) | [ODC-PDDL-1.0](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/pddl/) for the `datasets/co2-ppm` package. The original data is from NOAA GML |
